  speakerName: 
  storyText: You pull your phone from your pocket. The screen is cracked, glowing harshly in the dim room. You open the feed. The timeline is refreshing so fast it's making you dizzy.
  narrativeBeats:
  - "\u26A0 NO SIGNAL\n                12% \U0001F50B"
  - 'Trending: #SeattleLockdown'
  - "C\n                        \n                            CityScanner"
  - "@CityScanner_WA \u2022 2m\n                        \n                    \n                    \n                        Does anyone know what's happening at the 5th St Hospital? Seeing police in gas masks and riot gear. They aren't letting ambulances through. Stay away!!"
  - "N\n                        \n                            NewsWire Breaking \u2611"
  - "@NewsWire_Alerts \u2022 4m\n                        \n                    \n                    \n                        EMERGENCY: CDC reporting \"unprecedented neuro-aggressive pathogen\" causing extreme psychosis and unprovoked violence. Authorities urge citizens to avoid public spaces."
  - "U\n                        \n                            User_9921"
  - "@anon_9921 \u2022 11m\n                        \n                    \n                    \n                        [ATTACHED VIDEO: BLURRY]"
  - "Look at his face! That's not rabies! The cops shot him three times in the chest and he kept running! Oh my god, he's\u2014"
  - "[VIDEO ENDS UNEXPECTEDLY]\n                    \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                    Connection lost. Tap to retry."
  - 'The comments are a storm of denial, prayers, and wild conspiracies. One post catches your eye: a traffic map showing military checkpoints. They are barricading the bridges out of the city.'
  - Before you can scroll further, the little loading icon freezes. The signal drops completely. The internet is gone.
  - "/* Add information to the Lore Database upon leaving */\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                \n                Add Intel to Lore Database."
  dialogueLines: []
  initialFloorItems: []
  choices:
  - choiceLabel: Lower the phone and get back to reality
    choiceSubtitle: Add Intel to Lore Database.
